---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
const title='Contact Bursara | Streak Technologies Ltd';
const description='Discuss student billing, school payment receipts or Bursara Alpha with Streak Technologies Ltd. Find the team’s support email and Mauritius and USA phone numbers.';
---
<Site title={title} description={description}><main id="main-content"><section class="content-wrap contact-introduction"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="breadcrumb-list"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>Contact</li></ol></nav><span class="product-eyebrow">THE TEAM BEHIND BURSARA</span><h1>Let’s talk school finance.</h1><p>Tell us how your institution raises fees, receives payments and follows up outstanding accounts. We can discuss the workflow and help you choose a useful way to evaluate Bursara.</p></section><section class="content-wrap contact-grid"><article class="contact-primary"><span class="product-eyebrow">START A CONVERSATION</span><h2>A real person. A practical discussion.</h2><p>For product enquiries, alpha questions or support, email the Streak Technologies team.</p><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:support@streaktechnologies.com?subject=Bursara%20enquiry">support@streaktechnologies.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="contact-subjects"><a href="mailto:support@streaktechnologies.com?subject=Bursara%20institution%20enquiry">Discuss your institution →</a><a href="mailto:support@streaktechnologies.com?subject=Bursara%20alpha%20feedback">Send alpha feedback →</a></div><small>Opens your email application.</small></article><div class="contact-offices"><article><span class="product-eyebrow">MAURITIUS</span><h2>Streak Technologies Ltd</h2><address>Royal Road, Pointe aux Cannoniers<br/>Grand Bay, Mauritius</address><a href="tel:+2302152998">+230 215 2998</a></article><article><span class="product-eyebrow">USA CONTACT</span><h2>Speak with the team.</h2><a href="tel:+13075003256">+1 307 500 3256</a><p>Visit <a href="https://streaktechnologies.com">streaktechnologies.com ↗</a> for more about the company.</p></article></div></section><section class="content-wrap enquiry-notes"><article><h2>Before you get in touch.</h2><p>A short explanation of your institution, typical fees, currencies and payment arrangements is a useful starting point. You do not need to send student records or financial documents to begin a conversation.</p></article><article><h2>Reporting an alpha issue?</h2><p>Include the screen, steps you took, what you expected and what happened. Use fictional examples and remove personal details from any screenshots. The <a href="/help/">help guide</a> explains the current workflow.</p></article></section><section class="page-cta"><div><h2>Prefer to look around first?</h2><p>The alpha provides a financial workflow to explore with synthetic records.</p></div><a class="product-button" href="https://app.bursara.com">Open Bursara Alpha ↗</a></section></main></Site>
<style>.contact-introduction{padding-top:38px;padding-bottom:45px}.contact-introduction h1{font-size:60px;letter-spacing:-2.6px;line-height:1.15;max-width:750px;margin:0 0 24px}.contact-introduction>p{max-width:730px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.95;color:#6e7d92}.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:45px;padding-bottom:65px}.contact-primary{padding:37px;background:#172b4d;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 0 100%,#29456d 0,transparent 70%)}.contact-primary h2{font-size:31px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:0 0 18px}.contact-primary>p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;color:#b8c5d7}.contact-primary .product-eyebrow{color:#d3b775}.contact-email{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid #ffffff25;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff25;padding:23px 0;margin:25px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.contact-email:hover{color:#e2c78f}.contact-subjects{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.contact-primary small{display:block;font-size:9px;line-height:1.9;color:#9eafc7;margin-top:30px}.contact-offices{display:grid}.contact-offices article{border-top:1px solid #dce2e9;padding:25px 0}.contact-offices h2{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin:0 0 15px}.contact-offices address{font-style:normal;line-height:1.9;font-size:13px;color:#78869b;margin-bottom:15px}.contact-offices .product-eyebrow{margin-bottom:15px}.contact-offices>a,.contact-offices article>a{font-size:13px;font-weight:650}.contact-offices p{font-size:11px;color:#62738b;margin-top:21px}.enquiry-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:65px;padding-bottom:65px}.enquiry-notes h2{font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin:0 0 18px}.enquiry-notes p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;color:#758499}.enquiry-notes a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:850px){.contact-grid{gap:30px}.contact-primary{padding:28px}.contact-primary h2{font-size:27px}.contact-email{font-size:13px;gap:12px}.enquiry-notes{gap:35px}}@media(max-width:620px){.contact-introduction{padding-top:25px;padding-bottom:30px}.contact-introduction h1{font-size:41px;letter-spacing:-1.8px}.contact-introduction>p{font-size:13px}.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;padding-bottom:35px}.contact-primary{padding:25px}.contact-primary h2{font-size:28px}.contact-primary>p{font-size:12px}.contact-email{font-size:12px}.contact-subjects{gap:17px;font-size:10px}.enquiry-notes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px;padding-bottom:40px}.enquiry-notes p{font-size:12px}.contact-offices address{font-size:12px}}</style>
